  "notes": "{泳|およ}ぎ is the noun form of {泳|およ}ぐ (to swim).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {泳|およ}ぎが{上手|じょうず}/{下手|へた} (good/bad at swimming)\n- {泳|およ}ぎを{楽|たの}しむ (to enjoy swimming)\n- 〜の{泳|およ}ぎ (~ style of swimming)\n\nSWIMMING STYLES:\n- {平泳|ひらおよ}ぎ (breaststroke)\n- {背泳|せおよ}ぎ (backstroke)\n- {犬|いぬ}かき (doggy paddle)\n- クロール (freestyle/front crawl)\n- バタフライ (butterfly)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {泳|およ}ぎ: swimming (as activity or skill)\n- {水泳|すいえい}: swimming (sport, formal)",
